{"title":"2015 USAJMO Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_USAJMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Solve in integers the equation\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/6/a563dd59e15d5c2022ae9f69c6be35c042bec806.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2+xy+y^2 = \\left(\\frac{x+y}{3}+1\\right)^3.\\]\" width=\"240\" height=\"46\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_USAJMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>We first notice that both sides must be integers, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/4/9f482a912feda0cddb75f893863fd8584ba122ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x+y}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"44\" height=\"35\" /> must be an integer. \n</p><p>We can therefore perform the substitution <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/7/2e758f587ac2ff0104692cf11cca06a1dbc0fde6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y = 3t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"81\" height=\"16\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> is an integer. \n</p><p>Then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/1/7d1be87ff839593b8c1cfe64c3db49354964575c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} (3t)^2 - xy &amp;= (t+1)^3 \\\\ 9t^2 + x (x - 3t) &amp;= t^3 + 3t^2 + 3t + 1 \\\\ 4x^2 - 12xt + 9t^2 &amp;= 4t^3 - 15t^2 + 12t + 4 \\\\ (2x - 3t)^2 &amp;= (t - 2)^2(4t + 1) \\end{align*}\" width=\"309\" height=\"102\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/5/865d6cdd77d71c60fc1526c4af0badbc119d9985.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4t+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"49\" height=\"15\" /> is therefore the square of an odd integer and can be replaced with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/b/14b6073a9e2edfd5c6cece42cbb74de09248d4c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2n+1)^2 = 4n^2 + 4n +1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"197\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>By substituting using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/f/23f41178c0a1fa49439feba6ae1c82e86784719e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t = n^2 + n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"16\" /> we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/9/e19a4946e42bc6a3c4a0a646a380d29b7b6d79d2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} (2x - 3n^2 - 3n)^2 &amp;= [(n^2 + n - 2)(2n+1)]^2 \\\\ 2x - 3n^2 - 3n &amp;= \\pm (2n^3 + 3n^2 -3n -2) \\\\ x = n^3 + 3n^2 - 1 &amp;\\text{ or } x = - n^3 + 3n + 1 \\end{align*}\" width=\"336\" height=\"72\" />\n</p><p>Using substitution we get the solutions: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/8/e38ff4306abc9c70e754ab0ebf9b6d0b6346d8cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n^3 + 3n^2 - 1, - n^3 + 3n + 1) \\cup ( - n^3 + 3n + 1, n^3 + 3n^2 - 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"474\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017120504\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.019 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 37/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2192/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:14192:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017120504 and revision id 84135. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}